  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="78fd-0f5d-c1f1-29db" name="Frontier Horsemen (Alexander the Great) - List Notes" publicationId="0641-2ee1-c462-c414" hidden="false">
      <description>THE FRONTIER HORSEMEN (Alexander the Great, pp.99-100) - an AoA-style list for the Skythians and other horse tribes (a more detailed list is promised in a future supplement). Percentages are by points. The army must have an Army General. Cavalry at least 50%. Warriors up to 25%.
The minimum size for a regiment is five models. There is no upper limit. One model in each unit may be upgraded to Leader (+5 pts), and Musician (+5 pts), or Standard bearer (+5 pts). For the Maracanda scenario (not built) only Officers should be taken.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[The Frontier Horsemen]
  Cavalry: at least 50%
  Warriors: up to 25%
  THE FRONTIER HORSEMEN (Alexander the Great, pp.99-100) - an AoA-style list for the Skythians and other horse tribes (a more detailed list is promised in a future supplement). Percentages are by points. The army must have an Army General. Cavalry at least 50%. Warriors up to 25%.
The minimum size for a regiment is five models. There is no upper limit. One model in each unit may be upgraded to Leader (+5 pts), and Musician (+5 pts), or Standard bearer (+5 pts). For the Maracanda scenario (not built) only Officers should be taken.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
